{'symbol': 'ELV', 'date': '2021-11-03 08:00:00', 'title': 'SOMATUS AND ANTHEM, INC. COLLABORATE TO DELIVER PERSONALIZED, VALUE-BASED KIDNEY CARE', 'text': "MCLEAN, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $ANTM #CKD--SOMATUS, A MARKET LEADER IN VALUE-BASED KIDNEY CARE, TODAY ANNOUNCED A LONG-TERM, MULTI-YEAR PARTNERSHIP WITH ANTHEM, INC (NYSE: ANTM). TOGETHER, ANTHEM AND SOMATUS WILL CHANGE HOW KIDNEY CARE IS EXPERIENCED AND DELIVERED FOR MEMBERS OF ANTHEM'S AFFILIATED MEDICARE ADVANTAGE PLANS, SPECIFICALLY INDIVIDUALS WITH CHRONIC KIDNEY DISEASE (CKD) STAGE 3, 4, AND 5 AND END-STAGE KIDNEY DISEASE (ESKD). SOMATUS' SERVICES ARE AVAILABLE TO ELIGIBLE CKD AND ESKD MEMBERS ENROLLE"}